    "detailed_description": "WORKS BEST WITH PlayStation DUALSENSE CONTROLLER<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLunar Mountain is a 2D platformer game set on the moon. Players take on the role of an astronaut on a mission to reach the summit of a mysterious mountain that has appeared on the lunar surface. Along the way, players must navigate through treacherous terrain, With stunning lunar landscapes and challenging gameplay, Lunar Mountain offers a unique and thrilling gaming experience for players of all ages.",
